OL,3,GNEWSA'I knew I wanted to become a
OL,4,Afarmer at 15'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt an age when many teenagers were
OL,7,Fconsidering what career path to take,
OL,8,FAndrew Massey already knew exactly what
OL,9,Fhe wanted to do.
OL,11,FA visit to a family friend's dairy farm
OL,12,Fat the age of 15 sparked a passion that
OL,13,Fhas shaped the past eight years of his
OL,14,Flife.
OL,16,FNow 23, Massey, from Sherbourne,
OL,17,FWarwickshire, owns a flock of 16 sheep,
OL,18,Fbreeds pedigree Suffolks and spends
OL,19,Fevery day caring for his animals.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
