OL,3,GNEWSA'I knew I wanted to become a
OL,4,Afarmer at 15'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDespite volunteering for hundreds of
OL,7,Fhours on farms and building his own
OL,8,Fflock, he still needs a farm placement
OL,9,Fto begin his apprenticeship on his
OL,10,Fjourney to become a full-time farmer.
